OL,3,GNEWSAFour hurt and seven arrested in
OL,4,ABromley stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeven people have been arrested after
OL,7,Ffour men were stabbed in south-east
OL,8,FLondon, the Metropolitan Police has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FOne of the men remains in a critical
OL,12,Fcondition in hospital, while the other
OL,13,Fthree are being treated for injuries
OL,14,Fthat are not believed to be
OL,15,Flife-threatening.
OL,17,FParamedics and the London Air Ambulance
OL,18,Fwere called at about 14:20 BST to
OL,19,FBromley High Street, where one
OL,20,Feyewitness reported seeing a man
OL,21,Fwielding a machete.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
