OL,3,GNEWSAFour hurt and seven arrested in
OL,4,ABromley stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA KFC spokesperson confirmed a "serious
OL,7,Fincident" had taken place at its
OL,8,FBromley High Street restaurant and an
OL,9,Faltercation had begun there. The
OL,10,Fcompany said it was assisting police
OL,11,Fand "supporting our team members and
OL,12,Fcustomers at this difficult time".
